<p>(1²/2) - (0²/2)</p>
<p><b>Final Answer:</b> 1/2</p>

<br>

<p><b>Example 2</b></p>
<p><b>Question:</b> Evaluate ∫₁² x dx</p>
<p><b>Step 1:</b> Antiderivative</p>
<p>x²/2</p>
<p><b>Step 2:</b> Apply limits</p>
<p>(2²/2) - (1²/2)</p>
<p>= (4/2 - 1/2)</p>
<p><b>Final Answer:</b> 3/2</p>

<br>

<p><b>Example 3</b></p>
<p><b>Question:</b> What does a definite integral represent?</p>
