      <td>(egin{pmatrix} 4 \ 0 \ -2 end{pmatrix})</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Square Matrix</b></td>
      <td>Number of rows equals columns ((m = n))</td>
      <td>(egin{pmatrix} 1 & 2 \ 3 & 4 end{pmatrix}_{2 	imes 2})</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Zero / Null Matrix ((O))</b></td>
