    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Identity Matrix ((I_n))</b></td>
      <td>Diagonal matrix where (a_{ii} = 1) and (a_{ij} = 0) ((i 
eq j))</td>
      <td>(egin{pmatrix} 1 & 0 \ 0 & 1 end{pmatrix})</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Symmetric Matrix</b></td>
      <td>Square matrix where (A^T = A), so (a_{ij} = a_{ji})</td>
