    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><b>Skew-Symmetric</b></td>
      <td>Square matrix where (A^T = -A), so (a_{ij} = -a_{ji}) and (a_{ii} = 0)</td>
      <td>(egin{pmatrix} 0 & 4 \ -4 & 0 end{pmatrix})</td>
    </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

