<p><b>Step 1:</b> Left side (x → 0⁻) → f(x) = -x → 0</p>
<p><b>Step 2:</b> Right side (x → 0⁺) → f(x) = x → 0</p>
<p><b>Final Answer:</b> both equal → limit exists = 0</p>

