<h4>3. Caesar Cipher</h4>
<p>
A substitution cipher where each letter in the plaintext is shifted by a fixed number of positions <i>k</i> down the alphabet:
<br><code>E(x) = (x + k) mod 26</code>
<br><code>D(x) = (x - k) mod 26</code>
